          "summaryZh": "當某人並非立即明白,而是在稍後才察覺意思、規則或答案時,cotton on 十分實用。；cotton on 可以表示某人看到標誌、表情、例子或其他線索後,逐漸明白發生了甚麼事。；cotton to 可以描述人或動物逐漸喜歡或接受新的對象、地方、習慣或想法。；cotton on 與「明白」有關,而 cotton to 則與「喜歡或接受」有關。掌握兩者有助你更準確地理解口語對話。",
          "summaryEn": "Cotton on is useful when a person does not understand immediately but later notices the meaning, rule or answer. Cotton on can show that a person works something out after seeing a sign, expression, example or other clue. Cotton to can describe a person or animal slowly becoming comfortable with a new person, place, routine or idea. Cotton on concerns understanding, while cotton to concerns liking or accepting. Knowing both helps you understand informal conversations more accurately.",
