          "summaryEn": "Think about and think of help you explain what is on your mind, what you remember and what you may decide to do. Think ahead helps you prepare for future needs. Think twice helps you stop and consider possible problems before acting. Think back lets you describe memories. Think for yourself shows that you form your own opinion instead of simply following others. Think out, think over, think through and think up help you describe different stages of working with an idea—from inventing it to checking every detail.",
