          "labelEn": "TEST Phrasal Verbs in Use",
          "summaryZh": "test for 和 test somebody/something for something 可以幫助你說明醫生、化驗所和安全人員正在檢查甚麼。；test somebody out 可以表示讓某人實際完成一項工作,從而了解其能力和表現。；在全面採用應用程式、計劃、食譜、工具或方法前,可以用 test something out 表示先行試用。；TEST 片語動詞可以幫助你分辨:檢查某個問題是否存在、考察某人的能力,以及試用某事物是否有效。",
          "summaryEn": "Test for and test somebody/something for something help you explain what doctors, laboratories and safety workers are trying to find. Test somebody out lets you explain that a person is given a real task so that others can see how well they perform. Test something out is useful when an app, plan, recipe, tool or method is tried before it is used more widely. The TEST family helps you distinguish between looking for a possible problem, checking a person’s ability and trying a thing to see whether it works.",
