        "benefits": [
          {
            "titleZh": "回覆他人及與機構聯絡",
            "titleEn": "Reply to people and communicate with organisations",
            "zh": "write back 可以表示回覆某人;write in 和 write off for something 則可用來表示聯絡節目、公司或其他機構。",
            "en": "Write back helps you reply to someone, while write in and write off for something help you contact programmes, companies and other organisations."
          },
          {
            "titleZh": "清楚記錄及整理資料",
            "titleEn": "Record and develop information clearly",
            "zh": "write down 可以表示記下重要資料;write out 和 write up 則可以把簡短筆記或符號整理成完整文字、文章或報告。",
            "en": "Write down helps you record important information. Write out and write up help you turn short notes or symbols into complete words, articles or reports."
          },
          {
            "titleZh": "談論在故事或文件中加入及刪除內容",
            "titleEn": "Talk about adding or removing parts of a story or document",
            "zh": "你可以把角色寫進故事、把規則寫進協議,也可以把某人從電視劇集中刪除。",
            "en": "You can write a character into a story, write a rule into an agreement or write someone out of a television series."
          },
          {
            "titleZh": "表達判斷及正式行動",
            "titleEn": "Express decisions and official actions",
            "zh": "write somebody off 可以表示過早斷定某人沒有希望;write something off 和 write somebody up則可以描述正式的財務或紀律行動。",
            "en": "Write somebody off can show that someone has been judged too quickly. Write something off and write somebody up can describe formal financial or disciplinary actions."
          }
        ],
