        "benefits": [
          {
            "titleZh": "用不同方法處理日常問題",
            "titleEn": "Solve everyday problems in different ways",
            "zh": "work around 可以表示想辦法避開問題;work out 可以表示找出答案;work through 則可以表示逐步處理事情。",
            "en": "Work around can describe finding another way past a problem. Work out can describe finding an answer, while work through can describe dealing with something step by step."
          },
          {
            "titleZh": "表達持續努力和逐步進展",
            "titleEn": "Show steady effort and progress",
            "zh": "work at 可以表示努力改善;work away 可以表示持續埋頭工作;work up to 則可以表示逐步邁向較難的目標。",
            "en": "Work at describes trying to improve. Work away shows continued effort, and work up to shows progress towards a harder goal."
          },
          {
            "titleZh": "清楚談論人物和情緒",
            "titleEn": "Talk about people and feelings clearly",
            "zh": "你可以用 work on somebody 表示設法說服某人,用 work somebody out 表示看懂某人,也可以用 work yourself up 表示憂慮或怒氣愈來愈強。",
            "en": "You can work on somebody to persuade them, work somebody out to understand them, or work yourself up when worry or anger grows."
          },
          {
            "titleZh": "解釋供電方式和活動帶來的效果",
            "titleEn": "Explain power and physical effects",
            "zh": "裝置可以 work off a battery,表示由電池供電;運動則可以幫助你 work off 多餘精力、大餐後的熱量或怒氣。",
            "en": "A device can work off a battery, while exercise can help you work off extra energy, a heavy meal or anger."
          }
        ],
