        "benefits": [
          {
            "titleZh": "清楚說明人們如何維持生活",
            "titleEn": "Talk clearly about how people support themselves",
            "zh": "live by、live off 和 live on 可以說明某人靠一項活動賺錢、依靠別人供養,或靠某筆收入生活。",
            "en": "Live by, live off and live on help you explain whether someone earns money through an activity, depends on another person or manages with a particular income."
          },
          {
            "titleZh": "描述不同的居住安排",
            "titleEn": "Describe different living arrangements",
            "zh": "live in、live out 和 live with 可以說明某人住在工作地點、住在外面,或與另一個人同住。",
            "en": "Live in, live out and live with help you explain whether someone stays at a workplace, lives elsewhere or shares a home with another person."
          },
          {
            "titleZh": "談論原則、人生重心和困難現實",
            "titleEn": "Talk about values, purpose and difficult realities",
            "zh": "live by 可以描述奉行的原則;live for 可以表示生命中最重要的事;live with 則可以描述接受不理想的情況。",
            "en": "Live by describes a guiding principle, live for shows what matters most to someone, and live with describes accepting something unpleasant."
          },
          {
            "titleZh": "描述重要經歷和長遠影響",
            "titleEn": "Describe important experiences and lasting effects",
            "zh": "live through、live out、live on、live something down 和 live up to 可以用來談論重大經歷、夢想、回憶、尷尬事情和期望。",
            "en": "Live through, live out, live on, live something down and live up to help you discuss major experiences, dreams, memories, embarrassment and expectations."
          }
        ],
