        "benefits": [
          {
            "titleZh": "清楚談論讓步、放棄和失去希望",
            "titleEn": "Talk clearly about stopping and losing hope",
            "zh": "give in 表示停止抵抗;give up 表示停止某項活動或嘗試;give up on somebody/something 則表示不再相信某人或某事能成功。",
            "en": "Give in describes stopping your resistance. Give up describes stopping an activity or attempt, while give up on somebody or something shows that you no longer expect success."
          },
          {
            "titleZh": "描述付出、歸還、贈送和派發",
            "titleEn": "Describe sharing, returning and distributing things",
            "zh": "你可以 give of your time,表示付出時間;give something back,表示歸還物件;give somethingaway,表示送出物件;give something out,則表示派發物品。",
            "en": "You can give of your time, give an object back, give unwanted things away or give papers out to a group."
          },
          {
            "titleZh": "描述物件和地方的情況",
            "titleEn": "Describe what objects and places do",
            "zh": "give off 可以描述熱力、光或氣味;give onto 可以描述門窗通往哪裏;give out 則可以表示電池、聲音或供應停止運作。",
            "en": "Give off can describe heat, light or smells. Give onto describes where a door or window leads, while give out can show that a battery, voice or supply has stopped working."
          },
          {
            "titleZh": "談論秘密、控制權和投降",
            "titleEn": "Talk about secrets, control and surrender",
            "zh": "give somebody away 可以表示暴露秘密,也可以用於婚禮情境;give something over 表示轉交控制權或使用權;give yourself up 則表示投降。",
            "en": "Give somebody away can reveal a secret or have a special wedding meaning. Give something over transfers its control or use, while give yourself up describes surrendering."
          }
        ],
