          "summaryZh": "follow on 可以表示一條問題、一堂課、一個章節或一件事自然承接前面的內容。；follow through 可以描述球員擊球、踢球或投球後需要繼續完成的重要動作。；follow through 可以區分只是說會做某事,以及真正把事情貫徹完成。；follow up 可以表示再次聯絡某人、查看進度或採取另一項有用的行動。",
          "summaryEn": "Follow on helps you show that a question, lesson, chapter or event continues naturally from something earlier. Follow through describes the important movement that continues after a player hits, kicks or throws a ball. Follow through can distinguish between merely saying that something will be done and actually completing it. Follow up helps you talk about contacting someone again, checking progress or taking another useful step.",
