          "labelZh": "TURN 片語動詞的實際用途",
          "labelEn": "TURN Phrasal Verbs in Use",
          "summaryZh": "TURN 表達可以表示機器啟動、關燈,以及調高音量或暖氣。；你可以使用 TURN 描述轉身、翻面、翻身、向外或向上,以及上下顛倒。；TURN 可以表示某人到達、人群出席活動,或某人開始對音樂、藝術或其他事物感興趣。；TURN 表達可以說明一項決定取決於甚麼、某人最後採用甚麼方法、討論如何轉換話題,以及某人或生意如何改善。",
          "summaryEn": "TURN expressions let you say that a machine starts, a light is switched off or the volume and heating are increased. You can use TURN to describe facing another way, flipping an object, rolling over, pointing outwards or upwards, and becoming upside down. TURN can show that someone arrives, a crowd attends an event, or a person becomes interested in music, art or another subject. TURN expressions can show what a decision depends on, what someone uses as a last choice, how a discussion changes topic, or how a person or business improves.",
