          "variableZh": "保留原句中的人物、事物、時間和意思。；先掌握核心表達。在 We went round the building to reach the side entrance 中,核心表達是 goround the building。to reach the side entrance 只說明目的,並非核心表達的一部分。；外形相近的 GO 片語動詞可以有完全不同的意思。例如,go on 可表示「繼續」;go on evidence 表示「根據證據判斷」;money goes on rent 則表示「金錢花在租金上」。",
          "variableEn": "Keep the same people, things, time and meaning. Learn the core expression first. In “We went round the building to reach the side entrance”, the core expression is go round the building. The words to reach the side entrance only explain why. Similar-looking GO expressions can have very different meanings. For example, go on can mean “continue”; go on evidence means “use evidence as a basis”; and money goes on rent means “money is spent on rent”.",
