        "benefits": [
          {
            "titleZh": "清楚談論故障和突發問題",
            "titleEn": "Talk clearly about faults and sudden problems",
            "zh": "break down 可以描述機器停止運作;break out 則可以描述火警、打鬥或戰爭突然發生。",
            "en": "Break down can describe a machine that stops working, while break out can describe a fire, fight or war that suddenly begins."
          },
          {
            "titleZh": "描述不同形式的分離",
            "titleEn": "Describe different kinds of separation",
            "zh": "break away 可以描述船隻、動物或人突然掙脫;break off 可以描述某部分斷開或一段關係結束。",
            "en": "Break away can describe a boat, animal or person becoming free. Break off can describe a piece becoming separated or a relationship ending."
          },
          {
            "titleZh": "談論適應過程和減少單調感",
            "titleEn": "Talk about becoming ready or making life less repetitive",
            "zh": "你可以 break in 新員工或新鞋,也可以用不同活動 break up 漫長的一天,使生活不會那麼單調。",
            "en": "You can break in new staff or new shoes, and you can break up a long day with a different activity."
          },
          {
            "titleZh": "描述衝破障礙和突破界線",
            "titleEn": "Describe passing limits and obstacles",
            "zh": "break through 可以描述實際衝破障礙物,也可以表示數字超過重要界線。",
            "en": "Break through can describe physically passing a barrier or rising beyond an important number."
          }
        ],
