        "benefits": [
          {
            "titleZh": "使用 CALL 處理不同的電話溝通情境",
            "titleEn": "Use CALL to handle different kinds of telephone communication",
            "zh": "call around 可以表示致電多個地方;call back 可以表示回覆電話;call up 則可以表示致電某人或機構。",
            "en": "Call around lets you contact several places, call back lets you return a call, and call up lets you telephone a particular person or organisation."
          },
          {
            "titleZh": "自然談論探訪和召人前來",
            "titleEn": "Talk naturally about visits and asking people to come",
            "zh": "你可以用 call by 表示短暫探訪、用 call on 表示探望親友,也可以用 call in、call out 和 call over表示叫人前來。",
            "en": "You can call by for a short visit, call on a relative, call an expert in, call a worker out or call somebody over."
          },
          {
            "titleZh": "表達要求、呼籲和個人努力",
            "titleEn": "Express demands, requests and personal effort",
            "zh": "call for 可以表達公開要求;call on somebody to do something 可以表達正式呼籲;call oncourage 或 strength 則可以表示運用內在力量。",
            "en": "Call for can express a public demand, call on somebody to do something can express a formal request, and call on courage or strength can show the use of inner resources."
          },
          {
            "titleZh": "準確描述反應、取消和產品收回",
            "titleEn": "Describe reactions, cancellations and product returns precisely",
            "zh": "call forth 可以描述引起的反應;call something off 可以表示取消活動;call something in 則可以表示收回不安全產品。",
            "en": "Call forth can describe a reaction, call something off can cancel an event, and call something in can show that unsafe products are being returned."
          }
        ],
