          "variableZh": "疾病令他死亡。)The thieves carried the bags off.(賊人把袋子偷走。)She carried off the prize.(她奪得獎項。；使用 him、her、it 或 them 時,請按照以上例子放在正確位置。；表示隨身攜帶某物時,可以使用 around、about 或 round。carry through on something和 carry through with something 均可表示履行承諾。",
          "variableEn": "Carry off has three different meanings in this exercise. Read the situation carefully: The illness carried him off. When using him, her, it or them, place the word as shown: carry him through carry it on carry it out carry them off In the “take something with you” meaning, around, about and round are all possible. Both carry through on something and carry through with something can describe fulfilling a promise.",
