          "summaryZh": "bang around、bang about 和 bang away 可以描述有人走動、搬東西或不停敲打而發出很大聲響。；bang away at something 可以表示某人長時間努力處理一項工作。；bang on about something 可以表示某人不斷重提同一話題,令人感到厭煩。；bang out 可以描述大聲有力的演奏;bang into、bang up 和 bang down 則可以描述不同形式的碰撞或撞擊。",
          "summaryEn": "Bang around, bang about and bang away help you describe people moving things or striking objects noisily. Bang away at something shows that a person continues working hard at a task for some time. Bang on about something is useful when a person keeps returning to the same subject and becomes annoying. Bang out describes loud energetic music, while bang into, bang up and bang down describe different kinds of physical impact.",
