          "variableZh": "學習參考表所列的完整核心表達,不要把後面的所有詞語都自動視為固定部分。額外片語可能只用來補充方法、原因、時間或地點。For example:The campaign played on people’s fear.(這項活動利用人們的恐懼。)The campaign played on people’s fear by showing only the worst cases.(這項活動只展示最壞的個案,藉此利用人們的恐懼。)The words by showing only the worst cases explain how the campaign did it. The coreexpression is play on something.by showing only the worst cases 只說明活動採用了甚麼方法;核心表達是 play on something。；使用 it 或 them 時,請按照以下例子放在正確位置:play it downplay it backplay it outplay it upplay them off against each other；外形相近的表達可能有完全不同的意思,尤其要留意:play around = waste time or behave foolishlyplay around with something = try different possibilitiesplay something down = make it seem less importantplay something up = make it seem more importantplay up to somebody = flatter or please a personplay up to something = behave in a way that matches an expected image or reputation",
