            "titleZh": "使用 SET 描述不同類型的開始",
            "titleEn": "Use SET to describe different kinds of beginnings",
            "zh": "set about 可以描述着手處理工作;set off 和 set out 可以描述出發;set in 則可以描述天氣或某種情況開始。",
            "en": "Set about describes beginning a task, set off and set out describe beginning a journey, and set in describes weather or a condition beginning."
