            "titleZh": "談論差異、比較和衝突",
            "titleEn": "Talk about differences, comparisons and conflict",
            "zh": "你可以用 set apart 表示某人與眾不同,用 set something against something 比較兩方面,也可以用 set somebody against somebody 描述有人挑動雙方互相反對。",
            "en": "You can use set apart to show that somebody is different, set something against something to compare two sides, and set somebody against somebody to describe people being made to oppose each other."
