            "titleZh": "談論擦乾身體和處理表面",
            "titleEn": "Talk about drying bodies and preparing surfaces",
            "zh": "rub down 可以表示用毛巾把人或動物擦乾,也可以表示在上漆前磨平牆壁、門或傢俬的表面。",
            "en": "Rub down can describe drying a person or animal with a towel. It can also describe preparing a wall, door or piece of furniture for painting."
