            "titleZh": "描述塗抹和清除物質",
            "titleEn": "Describe putting substances on and removing them",
            "zh": "rub in 和 rub into 可以表示塗抹乳霜或油;rub off 和 rub out 則可以表示清除污漬或鉛筆字。",
            "en": "Rub in and rub into describe applying cream or oil. Rub off and rub out describe removing marks, dirt or pencil writing."
