        "benefits": [
          {
            "titleZh": "使用 SHOW 帶領別人參觀或進出不同地方",
            "titleEn": "Use SHOW to guide people through different places",
            "zh": "show somebody around、in、out 和 over 可以用來談論接待訪客、帶人參觀,以及協助別人進出某個地方。",
            "en": "Show somebody around, in, out and over help you talk about welcoming visitors, giving tours and helping people enter or leave."
          },
          {
            "titleZh": "談論展示物件或刻意吸引注意",
            "titleEn": "Talk about displaying something or trying to impress people",
            "zh": "show something off 可以表示自豪地展示某物;show off 則可以描述刻意吸引別人注意的行為。",
            "en": "Show something off describes proudly displaying something. Show off describes behaviour intended to attract attention."
          },
          {
            "titleZh": "描述到場和清楚可見的情況",
            "titleEn": "Describe arrival and visibility",
            "zh": "show up 可以描述某人到場、某物變得清楚可見,或某種顏色在另一種背景下特別顯眼。",
            "en": "Show up can describe somebody arriving, something becoming visible or one colour standing out against another."
          },
          {
            "titleZh": "談論令人難堪和揭露真相",
            "titleEn": "Talk about embarrassment and revealed truth",
            "zh": "show somebody up 可以表示令某人出醜;show somebody or something up as/for something 則可以揭露某人或某事物的真面目。",
            "en": "Show somebody up can describe making someone look foolish. Show somebody or something up as/for something can reveal the truth about them."
          }
        ],
