        "register": {
          "labelZh": "STICK 片語動詞的實際用途",
          "labelEn": "STICK Phrasal Verbs in Use",
          "summaryZh": "stick around、stick at、stick to 和 stick with 可以分別表示留在附近、堅持嘗試、遵守規則或繼續某個選擇。；stick by、stick together 和 stick up for 可以表示支持某人、保持團結,以及為某人或某個想法辯護。；把物件放入口袋、黏上標籤、開水煲、黏合不同部分或把報告放在桌上時,都可以使用 STICK 表達。；stick out、stick up 和 stick through 可以描述某物十分顯眼,或向某個方向突出。",
          "summaryEn": "Stick around, stick at, stick to and stick with distinguish staying nearby, continuing despite difficulty, following a rule and continuing with a choice. Stick by, stick together and stick up for describe supporting someone, remaining united and defending a person or idea. Use STICK expressions when putting things in a pocket, attaching a label, switching on the kettle, joining pieces or placing a report on a desk. Stick out, stick up and stick through describe something noticeable or projecting in a particular direction.",
          "contextsZh": [
            "談論留下來和繼續做某事",
            "描述忠誠、團結和維護他人",
            "自然地發出日常指示",
            "清楚描述位置和顯眼程度"
          ],
          "contextsEn": [
            "Talk about staying and continuing",
            "Describe loyalty, unity and defence",
            "Give natural everyday instructions",
            "Describe position and visibility clearly"
          ],
          "formalZh": "閱讀整句,選出意思相同的 STICK 片語動詞。",
          "formalEn": "Read the whole sentence and choose the STICK expression that gives the same meaning."
        },
