          "fixedEn": "Read the whole sentence and choose the STICK expression that gives the same meaning.",
          "correct": "stick around",
          "incorrectForms": [],
          "variableZh": "保留原句中的人物、事物、時間和意思。；參考表列出的是核心表達。其他字詞可以補充時間、地點、方法或原因,但不會自動成為固定表達的一部分。；使用 it、him、her 或 them 時,請按照以上例子放在正確位置。；有些表達看來相似,但意思不同。stick out 可以表示「顯眼」或「向外突出」;stick up 則可以表示「向上突出」、「張貼」、「舉起」或「行劫」。",
          "variableEn": "Keep the same people, things, time and meaning. The reference bank shows the core expression. Extra words may add a time, place, method or reason, but they are not automatically part of the fixed expression: stick around stick around after class stick something down stick something down with tape With it, him, her or them, place the word as shown: stick it back stick it down stick it in stick it on stick it out stick them together stick it up Some expressions look alike but have different meanings. Stick out can mean “be noticeable” or “project outwards”; stick up can mean “point upwards”, “display”, “raise” or “rob”.",
