          "incorrectForms": [],
          "variableZh": "保留原句中的人物、事物、時間和意思。；先學習核心表達。其他字詞可以補充資料,但不一定是固定表達的一部分。例如,sit by 是核心表達;and watch 和 while something happens 則解釋當時發生了甚麼事。；留意以下重要分別:● We sat out after dinner.我們晚飯後坐在室外。● I sat the game out.我沒有參加那場比賽。● She sat him down.她讓他坐下。● She sat him up.她扶他從躺着或靠着的姿勢坐起來。",
          "variableEn": "Keep the same people, things, time and meaning. Learn the core expression first. Other words may add information, but they are not always fixed parts of the expression. For example: ● sit by ● sit by and watch ● sit by while something happens The core expression is sit by. And watch and while something happens explain what the person allowed to happen. Notice these important differences: ● We sat out after dinner. We sat outside. ● I sat the game out. I did not take part in the game. ● She sat him down. She made him sit. ● She sat him up. She helped him move from lying or leaning to a sitting position.",
